  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-52a2142b-d26b-42a9-a335-bb5e95387ec0\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-910c24f9-a746-47e3-be8f-b54af926104a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9f14c92c-7f4c-4fae-a280-1e59768d4f04\">저는 원래 화장하기 전에 선크림을 바르지 않았어요. 근데 요즘은 자외선이 너무 세서 얼굴이 타는게 느껴지더라구요. 그래서 화장하기 전에 선크림을 바르기로 했습니다. 며칠을 선크림을 바르고 화장을 했더니 화장이 잘 안되더라구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-12594e23-2ab0-4f03-8451-c29c6b056ed9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-072ca2bb-1f1d-4ecc-926b-906f3f51387d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ebf679bf-ab89-4785-bb76-880f4c0d3dbb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0bf5f28e-2194-48d1-84bb-63951ffecab7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-843d2d73-2562-498e-94e6-2e5289cc92e6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-57d4389c-ca1b-4943-97a8-dba141f649a7\">처음에는 &quot;선크림 문제인가?&quot;라는 생각에 선크림을 새로 샀어요. 똑같았죠. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-145695e0-2699-41a6-9377-0ed78baf0450\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-27b602c3-0b89-46ff-a21a-84ff5d2c0166\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-73e3a680-fe6a-468f-8d3c-986eb5eea112\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-269788c6-3059-4800-a837-eba86cd29905\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-30106f9f-ecc6-4d4a-b747-13b1bcdebb1d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-238d9dda-9fbc-48fc-bdd3-5c8028ddc435\">결국엔 &quot;선크림이 나랑 안맞나보다&quot; 하는 생각에 선크림을 바르지 않았습니다. 그랬더니 밖에만 나가면 뭔가 찝찝하더라구요. 그래서 오히려 얼굴을 가리게 되었죠. 열심히 화장을 해놓고 말이예요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f014c92b-54f5-4872-8402-cccc840c5de0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-63ba39ab-0c7b-43a9-89db-0a3fd14a5685\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4e1631c1-18ce-4d7e-b0f4-f746ed2ebea5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-cc88708e-8b55-483c-a3bd-4fe6e29aa615\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4aee1f22-c3cf-4d73-ba87-eb2b87357d0b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d4b0e0d8-9ae2-4596-8724-fa93d9f2c528\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0dccb352-6515-43bf-b524-8ab63124fc34\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bc659ded-459c-4dea-a2f0-6ba2be66668a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-01587f59-2599-4dea-a1d4-6807d4dfc59a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3d1f3ddb-082b-4332-8ed3-3c687878abf1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f87d451d-97d4-4127-ab0c-17f8c59ebeea\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-96014d1f-3662-45b1-a19e-4229a89a35cb\">그러다 우연히 알고리즘이 추천해준 이 영상을 봤어요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bda60542-b53c-43f1-ac3a-4c2f90954928\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a7cc9f50-9536-425d-8772-8b2b87a26855\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-4a7544ef-af89-48bf-857b-89b807f6152a\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:452px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-4a7544ef-af89-48bf-857b-89b807f6152a\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDA2MDRfNDIg/MDAxNzE3NDY1Njc1NDAz.U-ST7d93COagfDpBoAVnZVRJSvK1gQKGjPuf7xywPE0g.h4PdpCjh0FRk7KaEAAAaRHaJi7Bya67Q6lKl3xnLGV8g.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"452\", \"originalHeight\" : \"1002\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDA2MDRfNDIg/MDAxNzE3NDY1Njc1NDAz.U-ST7d93COagfDpBoAVnZVRJSvK1gQKGjPuf7xywPE0g.h4PdpCjh0FRk7KaEAAAaRHaJi7Bya67Q6lKl3xnLGV8g.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-2468a3fa-d356-4549-aa1e-effab888a996\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d50939ce-0a66-44af-abd7-1a4bffea454f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d39e6ac4-88bb-4265-95fe-86cd7581287f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3b8af42b-e82e-4273-8146-e4932ace6b19\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-453c1621-443b-4b88-bf35-ca50673e374e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9e86f3da-2379-4681-9cd2-7796ac1145c9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8d1631d8-f66d-48d2-96c1-babcb55ca781\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e0a6a903-ece4-4eaa-a27e-c67536333908\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-09261d64-dfb4-411e-949d-f6c3e9d61df6\">충격받았죠. 제품의 문제도 아니었고, 내 얼굴에 안 맞는 것도 아니었어요. 그냥 잘 못 바른거였어요. 선크림을 너무 많이 바른거죠. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3c56a200-d4b8-4cfb-b03a-565a1af764b6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-12fa8a5c-00df-4421-9f9f-5b83e6974dcb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6b024e72-579d-4f50-9269-378b344c46ff\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-15866f2c-9e17-49b0-a3cc-3cda0f8f780c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" s